@parkroseperma.bsky.social If you're not already planning something for this Sunday, the 8th, you're invited up to Olympia WA for a short Knit-In/Hangout!!

It's a simple gathering at Tivoli Fountain on the Capitol Campus,  in support of the National Angry Knit-In & International Women's Day
